then select "Policy on Lehigh's Coputer Usage."

[...]
>Those who do not abide by the policies listed below should expect at
>least suspension of computer privileges and possible referral to the
>University Committee on Discipline.
[...]

This suggests that the Computer Center claims authority to avoid the
univerity's due process procedure and investigate, judge, and punish
users on its own. The policy could be improved by respecting user's
due process rights.

>Should the security of a computer system be threatened, user files
>may be examined under the direction of the Computing Center Director.

