I respectfully disagree - the above statement is bullshit, methinks.
Many mainstream newsgroups are in the state of a permanent flamefest,
quite unlike the peaceful and thoughtful alt hierarchy groups like,
for instance, alt.fan.[insert_the_name_of_your_favorite_writer_here].

